 steady lead in October surveys, including polls from Republican-affiliated firms showing her ahead by five to six points. Editorial ratings across the spectrum call the race for Democrats, ranging from Tilt D to Solid D.\n\nHobbs has raised roughly $10.1 million to Biggs' $3.2 million and has outspent him on the airwaves, while prediction markets place her chances near 90 percent. Biggs has campaigned on fuel prices and water, and Democrats have attacked him over rising costs. Arizona's slight Republican tilt keeps the contest competitive, but incumbency, money, and stable polling give Hobbs the edge heading into Election Day.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9144, "margin": 7.07}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9047, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9201, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9198, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.8839, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.8882, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.8963, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.8934, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.8924, "margin": 6.8}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.8871, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.8786, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.8851, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.8914, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.8731, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.8768, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.879, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.8914, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.8721, "margin": 6.3}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.8602, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.8941, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9114, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.8855, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9073, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.8931, "margin": 7.0}, {"date